    "Details": "The Stormcrow is a wide-spread, second generation OmniMech fielded by many Clans. The Stormcrow is built on a lightweight Endo Steel chassis and is powered by a 330 XL engine. The Stormcrow is protected by nine and a half tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. The TC configuration of the Stormcrow carries a mammoth Gauss Rifle for primary punch while a quartet of ER Medium Lasers provides ammo-free firepower. All of this is tied into an advanced FCS for extra effectiveness in combat.",
